  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/856/904/luckyegg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"385\" height=\"68\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">你的任務是找出隱藏的彩蛋。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">每個彩蛋都經過精心隱藏，需要玩家機智且細心觀察。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">你能找到所有的彩蛋嗎？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">每個彩蛋都會掉落隨機物品。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/856/905/mapp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"68\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/629/689/ccc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/792/86/lucky.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1124\" height=\"586\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/629/690/ddd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>",
